# tab-series (M8's judgment; plan call 3 f, call 5): plain Tab from no focus through every stop of
# the page at rest, in FV 07's reading order as Chromium tabs it: the wordmark, the gear, the picked
# option, a's flip, a's box, k's box, b's flip, b's box, h's box, P's track, the plane, Return to
# origin, the zoom control; a 14th Tab leaves the stops (Chromium's goes to the page's body, the
# next comes back at the wordmark). Each stop's focus ring (3 px of --primary at 32 %): the
# origin's and the zoom capsule's lines turn --primary, the track's ring is its thumb's with the
# value tip over it, the plane's frame turns --primary and the plane's keys show at the panel's foot
# (35, 805.5, 422 x 62). WebKit's plain Tab skips the link and the buttons (8 stops), so this is
# judged against Chromium.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
tab
wait 16
shot tab-01-wordmark
tab
wait 16
shot tab-02-gear
tab
wait 16
shot tab-03-picker
tab
wait 16
shot tab-04-a-flip
tab
wait 16
shot tab-05-a-box
tab
wait 16
shot tab-06-k-box
tab
wait 16
shot tab-07-b-flip
tab
wait 16
shot tab-08-b-box
tab
wait 16
shot tab-09-h-box
tab
wait 16
shot tab-10-track
tab
wait 16
shot tab-11-plane
tab
wait 16
shot tab-12-origin
tab
wait 16
shot tab-13-zoom
tab
wait 16
shot tab-14-left
